# Data Factory: source (*.py), locked_thresholds.json, and the Phase 3
# eval-set lock manifest (phase3_eval/phase3_eval_lock.json) ARE tracked --
# they are the "locked before evaluation" artifacts the whole discipline
# depends on. Only the fully-regenerable scratch output stays ignored
# (large CSVs are already covered by the global *.csv rule above; these
# entries additionally drop the regenerated JSON manifests in the two
# directories that are wiped and rebuilt on every run).
backend/data_factory/output/
backend/data_factory/registry/